    "type": "game",
    "name": "Untold Chronicles: The Harvest",
    "steam_appid": 3388330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/841be1c7ad99eb1bff19e20aa593939d.avif?t=1755581334\" width=600 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/13208bdd3dbab6d2ea31c0d383ee3bf9.webp?t=1755581334\" width=200 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amid endless cornfields and the echo of an unsettling silence lies a farm where something feels off. Here, the wind carries more than leaves; it carries questions no one dares to answer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/a0a301fc25351540bd625dbf2c9c930e.poster.avif?t=1755581334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/a0a301fc25351540bd625dbf2c9c930e.webm?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/a0a301fc25351540bd625dbf2c9c930e.mp4?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Julio, a young man who never wanted to return to the countryside, arrives seeking answers about his grandfather. But as night falls, the solitude of this place starts to feel like a lie. There\u2019s something in the shadows, something watching, something waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/39110a7569d005cad9118fdd94420e36.poster.avif?t=1755581334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/39110a7569d005cad9118fdd94420e36.webm?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/39110a7569d005cad9118fdd94420e36.mp4?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you explore, the familiarity of the surroundings transforms into a maze of uncertainty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/bffb34f59c71d893ad3526775870c93e.poster.avif?t=1755581334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/bffb34f59c71d893ad3526775870c93e.webm?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/bffb34f59c71d893ad3526775870c93e.mp4?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Every sound, every shadow seems designed to remind you that you\u2019re not alone. The unknown surrounds you\u2014unseen but tangible\u2014playing with your senses and challenging your perception of reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/777a7171b04693185783a51b04c2b560.poster.avif?t=1755581334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/777a7171b04693185783a51b04c2b560.webm?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/777a7171b04693185783a51b04c2b560.mp4?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In The Harvest, terror doesn\u2019t impose itself; it whispers. It\u2019s a murmur in the wind, a figure that vanishes when you turn your head. What you uncover will change not only Julio\u2019s life but your understanding of what it means to be watched.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who\u2019s really harvesting?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror</strong>, emphasizing atmosphere, tension, and a constant sense of dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person exploration</strong>, designed to fully immerse you in the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deep, linear narrative</strong>, with unexpected twists that linger long after the credits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic visuals</strong>, maximizing immersion with every detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A detailed soundscape</strong>, turning silence and noise into instruments of fear.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/841be1c7ad99eb1bff19e20aa593939d.avif?t=1755581334\" width=600 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/13208bdd3dbab6d2ea31c0d383ee3bf9.webp?t=1755581334\" width=200 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amid endless cornfields and the echo of an unsettling silence lies a farm where something feels off. Here, the wind carries more than leaves; it carries questions no one dares to answer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/a0a301fc25351540bd625dbf2c9c930e.poster.avif?t=1755581334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/a0a301fc25351540bd625dbf2c9c930e.webm?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/a0a301fc25351540bd625dbf2c9c930e.mp4?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Julio, a young man who never wanted to return to the countryside, arrives seeking answers about his grandfather. But as night falls, the solitude of this place starts to feel like a lie. There\u2019s something in the shadows, something watching, something waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/39110a7569d005cad9118fdd94420e36.poster.avif?t=1755581334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/39110a7569d005cad9118fdd94420e36.webm?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/39110a7569d005cad9118fdd94420e36.mp4?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you explore, the familiarity of the surroundings transforms into a maze of uncertainty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/bffb34f59c71d893ad3526775870c93e.poster.avif?t=1755581334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/bffb34f59c71d893ad3526775870c93e.webm?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/bffb34f59c71d893ad3526775870c93e.mp4?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Every sound, every shadow seems designed to remind you that you\u2019re not alone. The unknown surrounds you\u2014unseen but tangible\u2014playing with your senses and challenging your perception of reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/777a7171b04693185783a51b04c2b560.poster.avif?t=1755581334\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/777a7171b04693185783a51b04c2b560.webm?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388330/extras/777a7171b04693185783a51b04c2b560.mp4?t=1755581334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In The Harvest, terror doesn\u2019t impose itself; it whispers. It\u2019s a murmur in the wind, a figure that vanishes when you turn your head. What you uncover will change not only Julio\u2019s life but your understanding of what it means to be watched.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who\u2019s really harvesting?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological horror</strong>, emphasizing atmosphere, tension, and a constant sense of dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person exploration</strong>, designed to fully immerse you in the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deep, linear narrative</strong>, with unexpected twists that linger long after the credits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photorealistic visuals</strong>, maximizing immersion with every detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A detailed soundscape</strong>, turning silence and noise into instruments of fear.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In this field, what is harvested doesn\u2019t sprout from the earth. Something hides among the cornfields, watching all the time. Explore and dare to see what the earth itself tries to conceal\u2026 because this time, you are part of the harvest.",
